herbstluftwm herbstclient compton polyframes polybar rofi hsetroot xset dunst notify-send jq rg fzf gh qutebrowser batcat btop mutt sff pfs-open gdebi paplay
# sff -> apt sff; pfs-open -> apt pfs-utils (ubuntu.deploy alias);
# paplay -> apt pulseaudio-utils (ubuntu.deploy alias) — the notification
# player behind dunst-sound (the dunstrc [sound-all] rule).
# gdebi -> apt gdebi + gdebi-core (the GUI depends on gdebi-core).
# pfs-common has NO binary — the desktop-environment adapter owns it.
